24.4pt"><span lang="EN-GB">APPEAL from a judgment of the Alberta Court of Appeal (Russell, Hunt and Paperny&nbsp;JJ.A.) in <i>Henry v. Henry </i>(2005), 249&nbsp;D.L.R. (4th)&nbsp;141, 38&nbsp;Alta. L.R. (4th)&nbsp;1, 357&nbsp;A.R.&nbsp;388, </span>334 W.A.C. 388,<span lang="EN-GB"> 7&nbsp;R.F.L. (6th)&nbsp;275, [2005] A.J. No.&nbsp;4 (QL), 2005&nbsp;ABCA&nbsp;5, affirming a decision of Rowbotham&nbsp;J. (2003), 20&nbsp;Alta. L.R. (4th)&nbsp;300, 344&nbsp;A.R.&nbsp;377, 43&nbsp;R.F.L. (5th)&nbsp;357, [2003] A.J. No.&nbsp;1056 (QL), 2003&nbsp;ABQB&nbsp;717.&nbsp; Appeal dismissed.</span></p>
